From: Project Luma <luma@local>
Subject: [PATCH] Use the final private Mutter typelib directory at runtime

The bake-off resolves Mutter through a staged pkg-config prefix. Embedding
that staging directory as MUTTER_TYPELIB_DIR makes GI dlopen a second copy of
Mutter after the installed copy has already been linked, which causes a
duplicate ClutterActor registration and aborts the session.

Retain the dependency-provided directory for build rpaths, but compile the
final private-prefix typelib directory into the installed shell.
---
 meson.build     | 6 ++++++
 src/meson.build | 2 +-
 2 files changed, 7 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/meson.build b/meson.build
index 7b15b4e..bf4ea78 100644
--- a/meson.build
+++ b/meson.build
@@ -140,6 +140,12 @@ if get_option('man')
 endif
 
 mutter_typelibdir = mutter_dep.get_variable('typelibdir')
+# The bake-off build resolves Mutter from a staging pkg-config prefix. That
+# path is valid while linking, but embedding it in the installed shell makes
+# GI load a second copy of Mutter alongside the one already linked from the
+# final private prefix. Keep the dependency-provided directory for build
+# rpaths and use the final install directory for runtime GI discovery.
+mutter_runtime_typelibdir = join_paths(libdir, 'mutter-' + mutter_api_version)
 python = find_program('python3')
 gjs = find_program('gjs')
 generate_app_list = find_program('meson/generate-app-list.py')
diff --git a/src/meson.build b/src/meson.build
index b365bcc..a3f5c24 100644
--- a/src/meson.build
+++ b/src/meson.build
@@ -44,6 +44,6 @@ endif
 
 typelib_cflags = [
-  '-DMUTTER_TYPELIB_DIR="@0@"'.format(mutter_typelibdir),
+  '-DMUTTER_TYPELIB_DIR="@0@"'.format(mutter_runtime_typelibdir),
   '-DSHELL_TYPELIB_DIR="@0@"'.format(pkglibdir),
 ]
 
